---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultationCTA from '../components/ConsultationCTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your First Visit | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Know what to expect at your complimentary orthodontic consultation in East Memphis, including patient forms, your exam, insurance, and payment options.">
  <main id="main" class="interior-page">
    <section class="patient-intro" aria-labelledby="patient-title"><div class="container"><div class="page-title-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">New patients</p><h1 id="patient-title">A comfortable<br>place to <em>begin.</em></h1></div><div class="page-intro-copy"><p>Your first visit is about getting to know each other, understanding your smile, and making a plan together.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#form">Plan your first visit</a><span class="visit-note">Your consultation is complimentary.</span></div></div><div class="patient-photo"><img src="/assets/first-visit.webp" alt="A child with braces and a parent discussing orthodontic care" width="1000" height="667" fetchpriority="high"></div></div></section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="expect-title"><div class="container editorial-grid"><div><h2 id="expect-title">Here’s what<br>to expect.</h2><p class="supporting-copy">Bring your questions. We’ll walk through the details with you.</p></div><ol class="appointment-steps"><li><span class="step-index">01</span><div><h3>Get ready for your visit</h3><p>Once your consultation is scheduled, our team will provide your patient forms in advance and make sure you have what you need for your appointment.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-index">02</span><div><h3>Get a complete picture</h3><p>We’ll take photographs of your face and teeth, digital scans, and X-rays. Dr. Rachel will perform a comprehensive orthodontic exam.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-index">03</span><div><h3>Talk through your options</h3><p>Dr. Rachel will discuss a customized treatment plan. You’ll have time to ask questions and understand the next steps, including payment and insurance details.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
    <section class="section ice-section" id="patient-forms" aria-labelledby="forms-title"><div class="container practical-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Before your appointment</p><h2 id="forms-title">We’ll send<br>the paperwork.</h2><p>All new patient forms are provided by our office ahead of your visit. If you’ve scheduled an appointment and need help finding or completing them, give us a call.</p><a class="text-link" href="tel:+19016250202">Call 901.625.0202</a></div><div class="payment-copy" id="payment-options"><h2>Let’s make sense<br>of the numbers.</h2><p>We offer flexible payment plans and accept most insurance providers. Our team will help you understand your benefits and work with you on a plan that fits your budget.</p><p>You’ll have a chance to discuss these details at your complimentary consultation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/faq/#getting-started">Questions about getting started</a></div></div></section>
    <ConsultationCTA title="We’re ready when you are." description="Contact our East Memphis team to arrange your complimentary consultation with Dr. Rachel." />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
